        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Robsahm, Joachim Trier, Eskil Vogt, Margarete Robsahm, Fred Robsahm, Linda Pedersen, Wenche Foss, Linn Stokke\n- Films: Louder Than Bombs, Begynnelsen på en historie\n- Roles: producer, director, co-writer, actor, mother, sister\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, Margarete Robsahm directed the Norwegian drama film Begynnelsen på en historie.\n- In 1988, Begynnelsen på en historie starred Linda Pedersen, Wenche Foss, and Linn Stokke.\n- In 2015, Thomas Robsahm produced the film Louder Than Bombs.\n- In 2015, Louder Than Bombs was an internationally co-produced drama film directed by Joachim Trier.\n- In 2015, Joachim Trier co-wrote Louder Than Bombs with Eskil Vogt.\n- Margarete Robsahm is the mother of director Thomas Robsahm.\n- Margarete Robsahm is the sister of actor Fred Robsahm.",
